  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block of ice of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> is at its melting point.</p>\n<p>A smaller mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> of water at a temperature of T °C is placed on the top surface of the ice and remains there.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The specific latent heat of fusion of ice is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> and the specific heat capacity of water is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What mass of ice melts?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mcT}{L}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mLT}{c}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{McT}{L}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{MLT}{c}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
